# Simulation outputs produced by the Rust examples + Python helper scripts
# (CSV spectra, PNG plots, MP4/GIF animations, field-sweep subdirectories).
# Every example writes here so a single rule covers them all — see the
# `OUTPUT_DIR` constants in `crates/nmr-sim/examples/*.rs` and the matching
# convention in `scripts/`.
/examples/outputs/
